#: scenario3:scenario3_2C7D3222_5934_4016_90AC_223BF146B92B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd7fc1c61a1aef3316446cd679acdcbe3cd77629ebe6ab47206ace2834b59152
#. default-sha256: c3821bd618ac786651620dc959414b3c03dcb62b66a5fa83591f5765431633ee
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2C7D3222_5934_4016_90AC_223BF146B92B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫This is something that actually happened to another maid."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫……传闻，⟪k:6⟫这是某个女仆亲眼所见之事。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_15CEB649_C9D5_44D6_A3C4_652322264F3A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13920ded3fffded89a08800be4df9c9bda3d183bb7570029bc0e8f8ec7d77bed
#. default-sha256: 6c5873e3a4b703dff768f2f35a171b8a91d07a542b4c7312e8a4ecbd1e4b0cc4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_15CEB649_C9D5_44D6_A3C4_652322264F3A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She heard a sound in the middle of the night.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A sound like dripping water."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫女仆在深夜里听到了动静。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫听上去像是水滴滴落的声音。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_1A67DF01_8DFF_43AF_A2C2_35B87AD7EB02
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 528edef17d867bda2a0fef58b0023018a72835f8964c3d53c7528a79c8302e95
#. default-sha256: a288a6bd6f5c61fb5f36b3b1b782b6a3548655ddf127596ba396c1f08d526dfa
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1A67DF01_8DFF_43AF_A2C2_35B87AD7EB02"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫At first, ⟪k:3⟫she thought it was raining, ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫so she looked through the "
"window, ⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫and there wasn’t a cloud in the sky to cover the stars."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫女仆在心中默念「会不会是下雨了」，⟪k:3⟫向窗户外面看去——却是星光灿烂的晴夜。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3A408E97_2ABA_4550_BE7E_A0D2A4BFEE38
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f73c37803175e5a9d038a7f196165b6612564364889590621394541bb8403f74
#. default-sha256: f8a3f73f77a65c20dd7426ad1ba099ebca19821275b2aea294f225e5d3d54e9f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3A408E97_2ABA_4550_BE7E_A0D2A4BFEE38"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Maybe it’s a faucet,” ⟪k:1⟫she thought, ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫so she stepped out of her room and into "
"the corridor."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫「那大概是水房传来的吧」，⟪k:1⟫这么想着，⟪k:2⟫女仆来到了走廊。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3C8694F4_1F6B_46ED_82AE_92B8AA9511A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1754d763677509e9f2bcc3aa0162c62f0deaab772a1b29d91c6ab2de784ad6d7
#. default-sha256: 81a0908ea21862437bb35d125196c6a46181650d9d42aa93a34e5892b5af9d05
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3C8694F4_1F6B_46ED_82AE_92B8AA9511A5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Compared to her room, ⟪k:1⟫it was unearthly chilly.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The maid regretted not bringing "
"something to cover herself with."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫和房间里比起来，⟪k:1⟫走廊有着刺骨般的寒冷。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫那名女仆十分后悔，⟪k:4⟫自己为什么没有披"
"件外衣。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_EE7EB345_D841_41BD_93D3_6E517DC6B2BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f44d9a9eebf406e2eff3232acd48ee5af9a2ee6db913deec501cf17eb93ed28d
#. default-sha256: f0431650dd7379b97c6f662b3d1b3b307cca07daa42f8bb90a07dd5ec4565b72
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EE7EB345_D841_41BD_93D3_6E517DC6B2BE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But that didn’t make any sense.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Normally, ⟪k:3⟫the temperature wasn’t that much "
"colder outside her room. ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Her nightclothes had always been more than enough for a trip "
"to the lavatory."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫可奇怪的是，⟪k:1⟫若在平常，⟪k:2⟫房间和走廊温差没有那么大。⟪k:3⟫去趟厕所的话明明穿睡衣就足够"
"了。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B5C1B330_DFCF_4896_B0FA_A84711D1E677
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e8705939738e8a8b7cc4f58e7276097818289b56db79e432ce13716bf8905a06
#. default-sha256: 9b9b0ebf3a7ddeec6e702f4bd3123ab573ed7a67bc124193cfad18b3aa69ecc4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B5C1B330_DFCF_4896_B0FA_A84711D1E677"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Wondering what the reason could be,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫she made her way toward the sound—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫but then, ⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫she realized something:"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫女仆边感到疑惑，⟪k:1⟫边向着发出声音的地方走去。——然后她注意到了怪异的事。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D6143D13_CF25_4EA4_97D8_20051D8A390F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bbbdb65ab6490e788aa6ec09ec89630a47662ccb5c774422a9831369990706b7
#. default-sha256: 131a11756dfd1066756297f3529553beb7c2830500a0d680c5ebad6a48a75ad2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D6143D13_CF25_4EA4_97D8_20051D8A390F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There were no faucets in the direction she was going.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Rather, ⟪k:4⟫she was "
"headed toward a hall."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫传出声音的地方并不是水房那边，⟪k:1⟫而是大厅附近。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B208F65A_77B9_432F_9AE2_D2921AE1D586
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d328ab1b4d8f55ec10c885785ae02ab3322d2594f38be8b8c3c250cd55f8bc34
#. default-sha256: 4636903dacf255519b3287eb0c5cec30eaaca9203b7baca70896158a19f1bf78
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B208F65A_77B9_432F_9AE2_D2921AE1D586"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The mansion where she served had many halls,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫but this one was off in a far "
"corner of the house—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫the least used hall of them all."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫这座房子里虽然有着数间大厅，⟪k:1⟫但声音却是从最里面的那间，从未使用过的大厅内传出。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_63382F56_7DA6_48AD_BDED_119E35E45464
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b15ba4e424dffb128c70d668e2991869969633e9b6998cf96cad5ece756b7ec0
#. default-sha256: e953673a6323708bf95728fa3b2b0e2752b988304ec2e791de483d4f2c165da5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_63382F56_7DA6_48AD_BDED_119E35E45464"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It had a high roof, ⟪k:3⟫but not a lot of space, ⟪k:4⟫so it was difficult to make "
"good use of. ⟪k:5⟫It also had a somewhat heavy air to it—⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫a very curious room."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫那间大厅天花板虽高，⟪k:3⟫面积却不够大，⟪k:4⟫因此难以有效利用。⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫空气也阴郁"
"潮湿。⟪k:7⟫总之是间十分怪异的房间。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A26C50DF_DB4D_42CE_A9E4_DA805B929169
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bfd63d70afef7f8f503cf44008664a97fee066c0d2f39fab47daf2f38f7b697f
#. default-sha256: acd3820dd74c6a33faff6a909178a69cea3a5c1c5c120d3f06d15311c3b7f9a2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A26C50DF_DB4D_42CE_A9E4_DA805B929169"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was the kind of place you might assign someone to clean as part of their hazing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫说真的，⟪k:1⟫如果被指派去那种地方扫除的话，⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫会有种惩罚游戏的感觉。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C75B4ECE_BC9F_41C8_A4D2_0EF2E18297BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4861ae5d8ce42a770eccd9d6eaf6a1b521e513a6be48202f70190a470ff67e29
#. default-sha256: b3e443774bdae37e5d4b7fa48163208ae374d54a97e23a1287d6fbdb882d9e6e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C75B4ECE_BC9F_41C8_A4D2_0EF2E18297BF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Anyway, ⟪k:1⟫when the maid realized the sound was coming from that particular hall, ⟪k:2⟫"
"she, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫as you might expect, ⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫let out an uncomfortable sigh."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫然后，⟪k:1⟫那名女仆，⟪k:2⟫发现传出声音的是最里面的大厅，⟪k:3⟫就不想再靠近了。⟪k:4⟫这也是理所"
"当然的。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_93B3ABC0_B4DD_42C8_85AC_1D062CCD5393
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 056ec21873cb3adadbd078190ee8761580b2cc148fe6a26df41992b0e38f3186
#. default-sha256: a271c52e9783462f75f034ffc9d6c506097618634c2bc91f4689ef03003403b2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_93B3ABC0_B4DD_42C8_85AC_1D062CCD5393"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But there might be a leak, ⟪k:1⟫and having noticed, ⟪k:2⟫she couldn’t simply ignore it, ⟪k:3⟫"
"you know?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但是，⟪k:1⟫也可能是漏水了，⟪k:2⟫既然注意到了就不能不去看看对吧？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5CC8E67E_AC08_46E9_AA96_498ADF5F22F8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 134a03a836a1e4371bb369b4df91243f41d9d796fd2d888e0e59609e803730e2
#. default-sha256: 5d4355c9dd50e8097c242a4b9897a528241ea49018f56b8e05d449c1f38fe508
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5CC8E67E_AC08_46E9_AA96_498ADF5F22F8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So, ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫as much as she hesitated, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫she pushed open the doors to the hall."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫于是，⟪k:1⟫虽然心底不想去，⟪k:2⟫她还是推开了大厅的大门。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_929EC2E4_9487_41DB_B985_2B84615F0B67
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d13c139014f1217dbedc839a7e0934e531230e53ac129bf2962c5bada25ab18d
#. default-sha256: 04383fb662b69b0f505da23bfb501610db84d250972ac997b571897f8b23b1b2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_929EC2E4_9487_41DB_B985_2B84615F0B67"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫There was nobody there, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and it didn’t look like anything was leaking, "
"⟪k:5⟫either."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……那里，⟪k:3⟫没有一个人。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫也并没有看到有什么地方在漏水。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9C6B3D19_44F9_4C43_B568_07FFC3049C94
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e08694d971c83bbe0dec808c420c9566bf1c92f94fe6c9e10f004e2ecf9e0c6d
#. default-sha256: 1b14ef31aec3b3719c046a00cfd6a9d0cbb7db1ccd9a6f28453ac04285283781
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9C6B3D19_44F9_4C43_B568_07FFC3049C94"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫There were no puddles ⟪k:1⟫or water stains ⟪k:2⟫anywhere to be found."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫哪里都没有被弄湿。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C5891E68_E1A5_47F4_AF10_ADEEB3EB16A4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 795f6550f9331daceb21369ac1cd16a134a50594c7c925df41b36d4bdf3e362a
#. default-sha256: e2d418301312d02a18d3eba948c8ba9403ce58a9e56fd6ad65ed6a3736c4a031
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C5891E68_E1A5_47F4_AF10_ADEEB3EB16A4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But she could still hear the sound, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫drip, ⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫drip⟪k:8⟫, ⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫getting louder and louder."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫即使如此，⟪k:3⟫声音还是没有停止。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫滴答，⟪k:6⟫滴答，⟪k:7⟫声音越来越大。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_6664CD0C_6260_4CEB_89D2_7EF9DD59AFA5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 63c7c0f977abcd8b3ecefadab4f285770a9b0c08636e40497ed13b6cd743ac1a
#. default-sha256: a5de18a15dc41348071b6d71b6849d6743236a46e459588bff9b5069ccd4a049
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6664CD0C_6260_4CEB_89D2_7EF9DD59AFA5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Slowly stepping further into the room, ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫looking left, ⟪k:3⟫then right, ⟪k:4⟫then "
"left again, ⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫she searched for the source of the sound, ⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫coming to a stop "
"in the center of the hall."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫女仆边环视着周围，⟪k:1⟫边走到了大厅中间的位置。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_03651C96_6874_4D7E_935B_1FC60862E4FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 31af1dbf97e3761dd21c3aa88f38fc5ddc9aab020f2edc76e07c8d26e702b2f1
#. default-sha256: dac22a38f8be800c5ca7a91ec8f5ba7af367b153af34cbb44d8424f20182d10f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_03651C96_6874_4D7E_935B_1FC60862E4FC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She stood there still, ⟪k:1⟫quiet, ⟪k:2⟫and then—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫a chilly spot on the nape of her "
"neck."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫没过一会儿——她的脖子上，感受到一阵凉意。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_428935B6_6158_4AA4_85FE_FE38123D2D94
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed51f05d5971eaddf34b7caf8331b91f95a4a9109b5f98316eca4e435fc0de31
#. default-sha256: 1685f0b259d33300bd0d8fe0ef2e024ed097cbf81ccd2f3dcc4a4476f43fefa7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_428935B6_6158_4AA4_85FE_FE38123D2D94"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With a little yelp, ⟪k:1⟫she reached back to feel her neck, ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫but it wasn’t wet."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫小小地惊叫一声后，⟪k:1⟫她摸了摸脖子，⟪k:2⟫果然还是没有被弄湿的痕迹。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7EDA7217_4C19_473A_AAF8_9A5DBE86FB9D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 07d3fe77fac750acade22917b46edf7529fbe011eb4c07f0c27ee9a409b16edf
#. default-sha256: cb86ee73c3a54c0ef03ecb2f4266afb02ceb3d583df12c35c28caabb3a734b18
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7EDA7217_4C19_473A_AAF8_9A5DBE86FB9D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Confused, ⟪k:1⟫she slowly, ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫warily tilted her head backward..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫好奇怪呀——⟪k:1⟫这么想着战战兢兢地抬头看去……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2E1B1B5B_DE17_4A4D_A3AE_D65844474192
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ff2654cfdd00b02562b6cff125adad7e23a3e1197864ad3cba5eaa14865e36e7
#. default-sha256: aa9f268453c4f3eb70e165db1ce3a17e864eea2aa68ea129f86978e5f8c09fea
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2E1B1B5B_DE17_4A4D_A3AE_D65844474192"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫and there hung a bloody "
"skeleton from the ceiling⟪k:14⟫!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫天花板上，⟪k:13⟫悬挂着流着鲜血"
"的白骨死尸！！"

